"The central question in AI isn’t open versus closed—it’s owning versus renting.”

@raffi  and Justin Hendrix discuss the AI security “Mythos moment,” the future of open-source infrastructure, the rise of AI agents and MCP, and why policymakers need to think beyond the model layer to the systems and protocols shaping how AI interacts with the world.

Tune in here: https://t.co/EyQJw6Nzto
